# Invariants

Read `spec/FOCUS.md` for the current Phase and follow it. The abstract loop is `process/LOOP.md`. Folder map: `AGENTS.md`.

Do not implement a Feature until `spec/<slug>/tests/*.feature` exists. Feature folders are slugs, never `feature_N`.

Edit rules and skills only in Reflection, or when the user explicitly asks.
